WEBVTT

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.330
The fourth match ended
with a surprise victory by Rose!

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.500
A single moment's distraction was all it took!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.200
Carmilla was the hopeless loser
we all took her for,

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.750
and she lost badly!

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.910
Mistress!

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.000
There, there.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.870
Now, to recap...

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:39.120
The winner of our first match
was the hero army!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.750
It was a great match!

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.200
You did great, Princess Buttocks!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.870
So many... It feels so good...

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.000
Why?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Even the name Princess Buttocks
that I found so humiliating...

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.790
Now I wear it with pride!

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.450
You probably got a new fetish!

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:05.830
And in the second match, the Orc King
and the Kobold won the tag match!

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:08.950
I'm honored to have been your tag partner.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.330
That's my line!

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.910
You're the best, King!

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.290
That's why you're the king!

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:15.910
We'll follow you forever!

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.290
Honey!

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:21.120
Daddy! Daddy!

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.160
I won!

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.540
You're the best, Daddy!

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.620
You're so strong!

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:30.080
I'm glad you won, honey.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.160
I fell in love all over again.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:38.870
I'm sorry. That's how it is, Genzo.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:43.000
I won't be able to be with you after all.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:48.040
I'm sure you can find
a wonderful wife of your own.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.620
Assumptions are awful things, huh?

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:57.290
And the Demon King from another world
won the third and forth matches!

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.700
I did it, Joanna!

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:03.790
That lesser vampire was no match for me!

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.660
No, you almost lost!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.620
It's gotten exciting.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:12.790
After the Demon King from another world
defeats that hero...

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:17.790
...I'll be paying Lindabulea a little visit.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:20.410
You shouldn't underestimate him.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:23.080
Lindabulea...

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.160
Joanna, I don't know anything about
the Demon King from another world,

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.660
but it won't go the way you think it will.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.620
What do you mean?

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:37.450
You'll know when you see the match.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:42.000
What? Are you trying
to solve this with violence?

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.540
That's right! Violence is wrong!

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.950
We'll talk later.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.450
Why is she so confident?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.120
Don't tell me...

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:04.870
The hero's wearing a mask...

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.370
Is that hero...?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:14.910
In the blue corner, weighing in at 178 pounds,

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:21.410
it's the leader of the Demon King army,
the Demon King from another world!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:25.120
MAO!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:31.660
In the red corner, weighing in at 198 pounds,
it's the leader of the hero army,

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:36.040
Animal Mask!

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.540
It's our last match of the night!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.950
Who will walk away the victor?
The Demon King? Or the hero?

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.500
It's a battle of fate!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.870
Fight!

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:24.950
"Hero x Demon King"

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.200
The battle has begun!

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:30.580
What do they have in store for us?

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.950
There's a tension in the air.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:38.370
I can feel the killing rage...

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:41.120
They're each planning their first move, huh?

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.540
Teacher...

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.250
I can see why he's our leader...

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.370
Genzo!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.620
They're both feeling each other out...

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.950
Neither are moving!

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:00.620
MAO's style is to go right for the throat.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.910
So why?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:05.290
Stay calm.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.120
if you hurry and go right for
the throat like you did before,

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:12.290
he'll just counter you straight into the mat.

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.750
The one who outsmarts
the other will win the day.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.580
Right, Animal Mask?

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.330
The winner is Animal Mask!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.290
Animal Mask is so good
at reading his opponent.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.410
MAO barely got in a blow.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.830
I must beat Animal Mask!
I must beat Animal Mask!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.080
I must beat Animal Mask!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.750
Don't push me! Don't push me!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.790
It's so hot!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.790
Just wait, Animal Mask!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.120
But... on that day...

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.950
They disappeared!

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:55.160
Animal Mask has disappeared!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:58.830
Ever since then,
my life's been nothing but suffering!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:03.290
Do you know the misery I've felt, Animal Mask?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.080
But today's the day I finally...

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:10.080
Why are you attacking first?

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.950
Because you didn't attack at all!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:17.040
Look! The crowd fell asleep
because we weren't doing anything!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.500
You're right!

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:22.500
Damn it!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.950
You've totally ruined the perfect

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:30.660
anti-Animal Mask plan I
spent months coming up with!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.080
You spaced out and went wide open!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:39.500
We're pro wrestlers! And we need to show
the crowd what it means to be pros!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.250
We can finally see some action!

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.160
You're too slow!

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:47.950
Bullshit!

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:50.080
What it means to be a pro?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.910
You ran from me! You're no pro!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.370
Ran? What do you mean?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.790
You know what I mean!

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:01.250
In our last match, you ran
because you were afraid of me!

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.580
I didn't run!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:08.370
I was supposed to beat you that day
and become the new champion!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:13.200
And I was supposed to beat you
and open a pet shop!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.910
And instead I found myself here...

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:19.080
Wait, how'd you get here anyway?

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:22.450
I just woke up in a weird castle...

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.830
Wait, is that what happened to you?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.870
I didn't see it, but probably!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.290
Then you didn't run from my match with you!

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.660
Of course not!

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:34.080
A wrestler accepts all comers!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.370
Then you'll fight me!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.540
I already am!

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.790
Yes!

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.870
Stop laughing and get back to the match!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:50.750
So what are you doing here?

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:55.000
I'm participating in this match to make
my long-held dream come true!

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.120
I want to open a pet shop!

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.700
A pet shop?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:00.120
You mentioned that before.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.450
What's this about a pet shop?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.410
Well, after our match in that arena,

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.250
I was going to begin a new chapter in my life.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.540
What?

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:15.700
I decided to own a pet shop and live my life
surrounded by the animals I love!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:20.250
Wait... this is a lot to take in and I'm lost.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.450
A pet shop?

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.950
Maybe I'll just forget it for now.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:26.250
They told me I had to beat a Demon King.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.500
I thought it had nothing to do with me,
but then you came!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.950
What about you?

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:33.620
I was told to defeat the hero.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:35.660
Are you the hero?

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:38.950
I keep telling them a wrestler, but yes.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:41.330
What's gotten into him?

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:45.040
Joanna, you hear what the Demon King
from another world is saying, right?

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.830
Is he maybe just a giant moron?

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.540
Don't say that! It's way too late
to do anything, so don't even say it, Rose!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.830
It doesn't matter, 'cause I'm
going to defeat you either way!

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.540
I'm done playing around!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:07.290
Animal Mask uses
the dirtiest tricks every time...

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.370
He knows I'm scared of dogs!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.250
No I don't!

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.790
He made that awful "Hiroyuki"
creature his manager?

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:20.000
That's right. My other weakness
in the battle against Animal Mask...

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.910
"Petting Zoo"

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.910
To overcome it, I...

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.160
"Petting Zoo"

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.160
Hello, everyone!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.950
See? It's so cute, isn't it?

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.910
"Danger
No entry!"

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.910
Hey! That's dangerous!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.580
You jerk!

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:38.040
Next time, I'll get you!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:48.580
Is he scared of Hiroyuki?

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:56.750
Joanna, is the Demon King...
scared of cute little demon beasts?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:02.000
Don't say that! It's way too late
to do anything, so don't even say it, Rose!

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:05.410
Then Rose...

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.450
We can use that demon beast...

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:10.160
I see, Joanna!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:12.370
Sneak, sneak, sneak...

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.870
Joanna!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:18.660
Come over here!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.750
Be a good boy!

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.370
You're so cute!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.700
Hiroyuki!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.370
We got him!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.290
We won't let you use this
to weaken your opponent...

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.410
That's not fair, hero!

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.950
What the hell are you doing?

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:39.750
Okay, the threat is gone!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.500
Wait, damn it!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.370
Be careful, please! Be careful, please!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.450
Rose!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.450
Be careful, please! Be careful, please!

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.660
We're sorry!

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.660
Be careful, please! Be careful, please!

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.370
They're coming this way!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.330
Stay away!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.410
Wait!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.410
Why are we running, too?

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:56.910
No idea!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:00.120
It's the only way to survive!

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.290
Keep him safe, Jeeg.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.250
Get back in the ring!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.250
One...

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.870
Fight me, damn it!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:17.330
Did you make them go after Hiroyuki, MAO?

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.000
I can't take this anymore!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.200
What did you say?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.370
That's my line!

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.700
My shop!

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:41.620
You wanna fight?

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:44.200
Then you've got one!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.870
I'm the strongest in the guild!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.870
I may only be half beast woman,
but my feelings are 100% real!

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:53.200
Great! Give 'em hell!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.910
Hey! Hey!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:02.830
Clause, were you getting excited?

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.660
No. Of course not.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.830
Nineteen!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.000
I will win, no matter what!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.410
For animals!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.160
Taste my special move!

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:44.790
Cannonball 450!

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.410
One!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.080
Two!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.830
Three!

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.580
Rhino?

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:49.000
I lost again.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:53.410
I can't match your love for animals.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.870
People who have something
to protect are different.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:04.250
I wanted to fight you more, though.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.540
You can any time you want.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:20.250
Pro wrestling really is the best!

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:30.540
The winner is Animal Mask!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:41.160
How wonderful it is to live with animals, huh?

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:49.080
One man uses a move.
One man takes the hit.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:53.330
That's how pro wrestling begins.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.790
The winners are the hero army!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.040
Genzo!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.910
Congratulations!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:09.250
We did it, Shigure. We won!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:19.000
The hero army gets the prize money!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:25.080
Clause from Cluster Bank will be
handing over the prize money.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.660
It's an honor.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.660
That was a wonderful match, Genzo.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:33.870
Let's do it again.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:38.160
I thought you were only interested in money.

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:45.120
Now your dream will come true.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:49.330
Yes. My dream to open a pet shop!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.410
Joanna...

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.790
Yes. There's no sense in staying here.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.950
Are you leaving?

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.750
Lindabulea.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.500
Tell me one thing.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:08.160
Is he really the hero?

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:11.450
He is.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.660
He is the true hero.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:19.700
I do want to make one thing clear.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:24.330
Carmilla and I will continue
to observe the hero.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.790
Your help is not needed.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.410
We'll get you yet!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:34.120
Just not today!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.370
Stupid! Dummy!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.830
Have a nice day.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.410
Great work today, Shigure.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:48.200
You, too.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:51.500
Now, let's get to the point.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:54.910
We exceeded expectations
in a number of ways today.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.660
Ticket sales and merchandise and food sales...

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.580
Look at it all.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.830
But unfortunately,
Genzo and the other wrestlers

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:10.040
far exceeded that number
in their destructive path.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:13.000
Here's the repair bill
for the stalls and the tent.

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:22.500
Add in the food and drink costs
from Hanako and Carmilla,

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:24.660
and what's left for you is...

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.080
What's left for you is this.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.330
Shigure?

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.870
Did something happen?

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:41.080
How much did you two eat and drink?!

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:45.910
Cheers!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.160
Cheers!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.160
Cheers!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.620
Watch me!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.750
This is great!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.290
Drink up!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.250
Genzo!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.830
Shigure, that tournament was great!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:15.750
Oh, you came at the perfect time!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.330
Pay this whenever you can!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:25.330
How much did you guys eat and drink?

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.000
Sheesh...

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.580
A pro wrestling tournament, huh?

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:56.080
When will the next one be?

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.160
Princess?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.160
No. It's nothing.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:07.540
Oh, Shigure!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.000
Got something nice to sell me?

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.540
This, actually...

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:17.950
I don't know. We only deal in weapons.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:21.620
But you can craft this into a weapon.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:22.830
See?

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.330
Mythril?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.540
That would work!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.120
You're the best, Shigure!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.700
I sure am!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.200
You're leaving already?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:49.540
Yeah. I want to train and then
have another match...

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:53.080
No, do more pro wrestling with you.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.660
I see.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.000
See you around, Animal Mask.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.500
See you, MAO.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:07.370
I wonder where this road will take me...

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:11.500
Let me finish my sentence!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.950
Come on, kiddos!

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:18.410
Its time for lunch!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:20.160
You're still here?!

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.120
Crap!

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:26.160
You were supposed to go to the guild
to get a quest to pay off our debts!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.660
I was just leaving!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.540
Where are Hanako and Carmilla?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:38.500
Sheesh... None of you do any work
unless I'm here to tell you to do it!

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:40.910
Hey, don't lump me in with them!

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:42.830
Hey!

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.450
Big trouble! Demon beasts are--

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.660
What?

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.290
A minotaur appeared in the southern valley!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:56.500
What?

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.750
It's a very violent one...

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.290
How much does the job pay?

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:03.000
What does it taste like, you think?

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.830
Mistress, are you going to go?

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:07.580
I'll help you change clothes!

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:13.330
Okay, let's go meet the minotaur!
